---
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro'
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout
  title="TemuGlowz Terms"
  description="Usage terms summary for the TemuGlowz project and app surfaces."
  path="/terms"
>
  <main id="main-content" class="min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground">
    <section class="px-4 pt-24 pb-12">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="mb-10" data-reveal>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-card border border-border text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-6">
            Terms
          </span>
          <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4" style="font-family: var(--font-cal-sans);">
            TemuGlowz terms summary
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            These terms summarize how the current TemuGlowz project is presented in this repository. They are operational guidance for site visitors and testers, not a substitute for jurisdiction-specific legal drafting.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-6" data-reveal>
          <section class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card/70 p-6">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">Project status</h2>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              TemuGlowz is an actively developed software project. Features, availability, pricing language, and supported platforms can change while implementation and validation continue.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card/70 p-6">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">Acceptable use</h2>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              Users should only save, import, or organize product information they are allowed to handle. TemuGlowz is presented as a personal organization tool, not as a way to bypass another platform&apos;s protections or terms.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card/70 p-6">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">No affiliation claim</h2>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              The project documentation states that TemuGlowz does not claim official partnership, certification, or authorization by Temu. References to Temu describe compatibility targets and user workflows only.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card/70 p-6">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">Availability and warranties</h2>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              Public web availability, cloud sync behavior, and premium features are not guaranteed by the current repository documentation. Anyone evaluating the project should rely on the shipped code and current README before assuming production readiness.
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <Footer />
  </main>
</Layout>
